{"id":"53b642d4b3595748","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-relative-recursion.md","title":"相对递归定理","display":"thm-relative-recursion — 相对递归定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-relative-recursion","aliases":["20-thm-relative-recursion"],"display":"thm-relative-recursion — 相对递归定理","chapter":"3","section":"3.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 3.3.13","source_pdf_pages":[94],"source_printed_pages":[58],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-thm-relative-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-relative-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-relative-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-recursion — 相对递归定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.3.13"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_n^A=\\Phi_{f(n)}^A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_n^A=\\Phi_{f(n)}^A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将普通递归定理证明中的求值替换为 oracle 求值；自应用的参数编译器仍普通可计算，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的程序使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。固定点只在给定 oracle 下要求函数相等。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.3.13；印刷页 58；PDF 第 94 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_n^A=\\Phi_{f(n)}^A].","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-recursion]] — 章 3；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-recursion]]"}],"outgoing":["140cce30ee9c16d1","8b6134451906e575"]}